Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:05.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《红发会》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:52.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 对不起 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,sorry Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来得正是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you couldn't have come at a better time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怕你正忙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid you were engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 非常忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am,very much so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:05.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生和我一样 热衷于稀奇古怪的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson shares my love of all that is bizarre,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是日常生活中那些稀松平常的老套故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but outside the routine of everyday existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在还不能断定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is at present and impossible to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子是否属于犯罪案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this case is an instance of crime or no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:16.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是足以说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But suffice it to say that I know as little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于杰贝斯·威尔逊先生 我和你知道的一样少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about Mr. Jay Beards Wilson as you do yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了一些明显的事实外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beyond the obvious facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干过一阵儿体力活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That he has done manual labor at sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾经去过中国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it takes staff that he has been to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:27.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他最近还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that he has done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写过不少东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a considerable amount of writing lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我的老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How in the name of good fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您怎么知道的？福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you know all that Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:36.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真像福音一样确切 我是干过体力活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As true as gospel I once did manual labor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾在船上做过木匠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I started off as a ship's carpenter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的手 我的好仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hands my good servant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你右手的肌肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The muscles of your right hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比左手的发达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are more developed than the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那写作呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有别的什么更能说明问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else could be indicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}右手袖子足有五寸长的地方 磨得油光发亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the right cuffs are very shiny for five inches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}左胳膊肘那儿打了个整洁的补丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the left sleeve with smooth pattern over the elbow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是经常贴在桌面所致… 但中国？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you lean it on the desk... but China?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}右手腕正上方的鱼状纹身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fish tattooed immediately above his right wrist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对纹身略有研究 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have made a small study of tattoo marks,Mr. Wilson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还写过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have even contributed to the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:08.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这方面的文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}literature of the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}染鱼鳞的绝技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That trick of staining the fish scales,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使用淡淡的粉红色 是中国才有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a delicate pink is quite peculiar to China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有 我看见一枚中国钱币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherein addition I see a Chinese coin hanging{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}垂在他的表链上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from his watch chain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这岂不是显然易见的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The matter becomes even more simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈哈 真没想到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I never...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}起初我还觉得你真是神机妙算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought at first it was something clever,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说穿了 也没什么了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now I see there's nothing in it after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我开始觉得要是心眼太实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I begin to think that my reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会毁了自己的名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}such as it is will suffer shipwreck if I'm so candid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"不为人知者乃为壮丽"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}omne ignotum pro magnifico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解释之后 一切都变得平庸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything becomes commonplace by explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 这么翻译太不严谨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson that is a very loose translation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 请把那则广告给医生看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,please show the doctor that advertisement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 在这儿 您自己看吧 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,there,you can read it for yourself sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红发会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the Red Headed League.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于原住于美国宾夕法尼亚州的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On account of the request{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黎巴嫩人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the late Iscar Hopkins of Lebanon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伊齐基亚·霍普金斯之遗赠 现有空缺一名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pennsylvania USA there is a vacancy open{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}薪金为每周四镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which entitles a member of the league to a salary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}工作则实系挂名而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of four pounds a week for purely nominal services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凡红发男性 身体健康 智力健全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All red headed men sound in body and mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年满21周岁者 均可申请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and above the age of 21 are eligible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应聘者请于星期一上午11时 亲至舰队街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apply in person on Monday at 11:00 to Mr. Duncan Ross{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇院7号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the offices of the League,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红发会办公室邓肯·罗斯处提出申请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7 Copes Court Fleet Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事当真？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这则广告有点不合常理 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a little off the beaten track,hey Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麻烦你记下报纸名和日期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,would you make a note of the paper and the date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}<纪事年报> 4月27日 星期六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening standard of Saturday the 27th of April,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两个月前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do try this sitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 威尔逊先生 请说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,Mr. Wilson,off you go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}简略地介绍一下你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at scratch and tell us all about yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 先生们 我开了个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,well gentlemen I have a small{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小当铺 在萨克斯科伯格广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pawn broking business in Sax Coburg Street,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在市区附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买卖做得不大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a very large affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能勉强维持生计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just gives me a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:11.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去我还能请两个伙计 但现在只雇得起一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to keep two assistants but now I just keep the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实话实说 我原打算付全部工钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to tell you the truth I'd have a job to make you pay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这个伙计 自愿拿一半工资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the deeds willing to come at half wages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说是为了学做生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so as to learn the business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大约两个月前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About two months ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个热心肠的小伙子叫什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the name of the obliging youth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}文森特·斯波尔丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vincent Spalding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他算不上是个小伙子 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,but he's not such a youth either Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:33.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不太清楚他的年纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's difficult to say his age{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:35.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我再也找不到比这个 更精明能干的伙计了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I couldn't wish for a smarter assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的运气真不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem most remarkably fortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以低于市价的工钱雇到伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In having an employee who comes under the market price,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道你那个伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know that your assistant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是同那则广告 一样非比寻常？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not as remarkable as your advertisement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 他也有缺点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,but he does have his faults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他比谁都爱照相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,he was such a fellow for photography.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整天拿着相机到处拍照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always snapping away with his camera{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:56.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不愿在工作上动脑筋 然后钻进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he should be improving his mind and then diving down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}地下室去冲洗那些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the cellar to develop the wretched things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 总的来说 他算是个好伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still on the whole he's a good worker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么坏心眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No vice in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当初就是他 把广告拿给我看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was he who first showed me the advertisement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但愿我是红头发 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to the lord I was a red headed man Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在红发会里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well there's another vacancy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又有职位空缺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the League of Red Headed Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从未听过这事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never heard of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还纳闷呢 您本人就非常符合资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I'd wonder at that you being so eligible yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}薪金相当可观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice money too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一年200镑 活儿又轻松…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple hundred a year and the work's light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到时可得有成千上万的 红发人去应聘吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,there'll be thousands of red headed men apply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不这么认为 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,well I doubt that sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人有你这么火红的头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well nobody with such a fine fiery color{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同上天恩赐一般 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you're blessed with Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我想还是不值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I suppose it's only worth your while{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了那几百英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to put yourself out of the way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特地跑一趟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for sake of a few hundred pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 我很爱呆在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm very much of a stay at home sort of person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时候连续几个星期 我都不会踏出门口半步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes weeks on end before I put my foot over the doormat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这个看起来很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this it looked interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对此很感兴趣 而年轻的文森特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was intrigued and young Vincent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说他愿意陪我一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}said he'd come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以星期一早上 我们锁好店门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,on Monday morning we shut up the shop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便动身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and off we went.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}文森特 我们回去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,Vincent let's go back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人太多 过不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get by the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿出勇气 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Courage Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就快到了 正处在重要关头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're so near and so much at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在穿上外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you put your coat on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟着我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and come along with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 喂 喂 请小点声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohy,Ohy,Ohy,a little less noise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.55,0:11:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里 看这里 你什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,here what's your game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以走了 你是下一个 进去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go,you next,get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:31.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘿 你往哪儿走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边直走 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight this way,Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直接进去吧 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right in you go Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:52.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admirably suited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全符合要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every requirement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}静下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:07.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恭喜您 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再迟疑就太不对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be injustice to hesitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不介意我采取谨慎措施吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will I'm sure excuse me if I take an obvious precaution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}眼泪都流出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tears in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想必是真头发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I perceive all is as it should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不得不小心防范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被假发骗过两次 被颜料骗过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twice deceived by wigs,once by paint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有用鞋蜡来玩花招的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could tell you tales of cobblers wags{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您听了准会感到恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that would disgust you with human nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我叫邓肯·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Duncan Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自己就是基金的受益人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am myself a pension upon a fund left by{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:42.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一位尊贵的捐赠者遗留的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a noble benefactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就知道你要问我 伊乔基亚·霍普金斯先生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you're about to question me about Mr. Ethic Guya Hopkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他自己长了一头红发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was himself red headed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他年轻时离开伦敦去了美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In his youth he left London for America where he made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赚了好几百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}many millions of dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他死后 人们发现他曾立下遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On his death it was found that he had instructed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吩咐财产托管人让他出生的这座城市中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a trustee in his will to make life a little easier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生活着的红发人日子过得舒适安逸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the red headed men in the town of his birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝妙的颜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的全名叫什么？威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what's your full name Mr. Wilson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰贝斯·威尔逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jay Beards Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰贝斯·威尔逊 您结婚了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jay Beards Wilson and are you a married man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威尔逊先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wilson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有妻儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 我是个鳏夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I'm a widower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我从来就没有过什么家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I never had any family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哎呀 真遗憾听您这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh dear,sad to hear you say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本基金设立的目的就是为了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fund of course is for the propagation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.61,0:13:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红发人更多地繁衍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and spread of red headed men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}延续他们的血脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as well as with their maintenance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:47.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是换了别人 这个缺点可能是不幸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In another case the objection might be fatal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:52.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我想我们得破例照顾一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,I've think we've got to stretch a point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为您的头发长得这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in favor of a man with such a head of hair as yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}空缺已经有人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vacancy has been filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:15.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}空缺有人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vacancy is filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在请离开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您什么时候可以来上班？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,when would you be free to start upon your new duties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:48.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 这事还有点不好办 因为我本身也有做买卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,well it is rather awkward as I do have a business already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么时候上班？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would be the hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:51.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上午10点到下午2点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10:00 to 2:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上午生意倒清淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the mornings are quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也有个伙计帮忙照看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do have an assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 对我来说很合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,that would suit me very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:15:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}薪水是每周四英镑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the money mentioned,four pounds a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:02.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干些什么活？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纯属挂名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purely nominal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纯属挂名是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,but what do you call purely nominal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是说您必须待在办公室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,you have to stay in the office{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少在工作时间内呆在这栋楼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or at least in the building the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:14.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦离开 便会 永远丢掉这个职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you leave you forfeit your whole position forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于这一点 遗嘱写得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The will is quite clear on that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我不会离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,I shouldn't dream of leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何借口都没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,excuse will avail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管是生病 有事 还是其他原因都不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a sickness,business,anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您必须待在这里 否则会丢掉这份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you will remain or else lose your ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我清楚明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,I am quite clear on that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}具体的工作内容是什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what exactly is the work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的工作是抄写<大英百科全书>\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is to copy out the encyclopedia Britannica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是第一卷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is the first volume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您得自备笔墨纸砚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will supply the ink,paper and pen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只提供桌椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will supply this desk and chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下星期一能开始上班吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now would you be free to start next Monday morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yes,certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么再次祝贺您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then once again my congratulations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰贝斯·威尔逊先生 得到这个重要职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jay Beards Wilson on the most important position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've been fortunate enough to gain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:08.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是完美的头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful head of hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good bye Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干得好 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干得非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这条路最近 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the quickest way out sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我回到家仔细一想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I got home the whole thing seemed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整件事情太荒谬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on reflection to be quite ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁会立下这样不寻常的遗嘱呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would make such an extraordinary will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个如此慷慨的百万富翁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a very generous millionaire to make you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:42.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}竟让你自备笔墨纸砚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buy your own pen,ink,and paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:44.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是说嘛 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很快我便说服自己 这一定是个大骗局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I soon persuaded myself it was some great hoax or fraud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但到了星期一早上 又觉得只有笨蛋才会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then when Monday morning came along it seemed stupid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拒绝这样的好工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to turn down a good job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:17:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以 我去买了一瓶 一个便士的墨水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so,off I went and bought a penny bottle of ink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一只羽毛笔和七张大书写纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a pen and seven sheets of fools kept paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前往教皇院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I set off for Popes Core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.34,0:17:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 威尔逊先生 欢迎您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning,Mr. Wilson and welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我又惊又喜的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well to my surprise and delight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都很顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything was as right as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}桌椅都摆好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The table was set up ready for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}邓肯·罗斯先生也在那儿 等我了解工作内容后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mr. Duncan Ross was there to see I got fairly to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的工作也就真正开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My employment had truly begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天都是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The schedule never varied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从早上10点开始干活 下午2点离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My work started at 10:00 and ended at 2:00{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}12点半的时候有一小段时间吃午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a small break for my lunch at half past 12:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:18:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每星期六下午2点 罗斯先生都会过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every Saturday at 2:00 Mr. Ross would come in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发给我一个星期的薪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and give me my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}称赞我抄写得真不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compliment me upon the amount that I'd written{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我们一起离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then we'd both leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后罗斯先生把门锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ross locking the door afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.95,0:18:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现朝鲜蓟非常迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The artichokes I found were positively fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们也开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have a kind of a bloom on them but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.45,0:18:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得很有趣…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that was very interesting...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:32.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 这份工作很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,the work was very interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:35.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}算盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abacus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}abbey,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}建筑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}architecture,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3} 《使徒行传》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acts of the Apostles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}劣质品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}adulteration,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解剖学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anatomy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:50.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大猩猩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}apes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马引水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aquaducts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}八个星期一晃而过 我差不多抄完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After eight weeks I'd fairly dealt with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以字母A开头的词条了 期望通过不懈努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the letter "A" and was hoping the diligence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.07,0:19:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早日抄到B开头的词条 但今天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get onto "B" when suddenly this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整件事情突然结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the whole business came to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我像往常一样去上班 发现门关着 锁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to my work as usual but the door was shut{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面还有一张方形的卡片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and locked with a little square of cardboard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用图钉钉在门板中央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hammered onto the middle panel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.43,0:19:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(红发会即日起解散)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您今天早上有见过邓肯·罗斯先生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen Mr. Duncan Ross this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗斯 罗斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ross,Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从未听说过这个人 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never heard of a gentleman with that name,sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记性很好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my memory is good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 不会错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very good,it's infallible to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 7号办公室的那位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,the gentleman in number seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 那位红头发的先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,the gentleman who is red headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:34.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 对 对 对 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,yes,yes,yes,gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉·莫里斯先生 是一名律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. William Morris,solicitor using my room as{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他的办公室布置好之前暂时租用我的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a temporary convenience until his new premises were ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨天就搬走了 房租也付清了 一分都不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moved out yesterday,paid in full,doesn't owe a penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里斯先生 我上哪儿可以找到他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Morris,where can I find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到他的新办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At his new offices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉·莫里斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William Morris...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:55.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华国王街17号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}17 King Edwards Street,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在圣保罗教堂附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near St. Paul's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:19:59.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(巴基父子护膝制造厂)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:53.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不觉得这有什么好笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see that there's anything very funny about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你们只会笑话我 我可以另请高明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If all you can do is laugh at me well I can go elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 威尔逊先生 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,Mr. Wilson please,please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:04.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝对不会错过这个案子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't miss this case for the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这太不寻常了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is most refreshingly unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被人这样欺骗 我气到不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so incensed with the forgery of deceit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以直接就来找你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I came straight to you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说你很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having heard of your great reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为需要帮助的人出谋划策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for helping poor people in distress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.07,0:21:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威尔逊先生 我真的觉得你不该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Mr. Wilson I really don't think that you've got{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱怨这个极不寻常的红发会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any great grievance against this extraordinary league.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正好相反 您倒赚不少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the contrary you've been very well paid to say nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更不用说您长了见识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the detailed knowledge which you've acquired{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}熟知了全部字母A为首的词条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on every subject under the letter A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但他们为什么要对我开这个大玩笑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,but what's the object of them playing this prank on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我想知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what I want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那个伙计 在你那儿干了多久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This assistant of yours,how long has he been with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:56.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大约三个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well about three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.39,0:21:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是怎么来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看广告应征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the answer to an advertisement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:21:59.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是唯一的应征者？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was he the only applicant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:02.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是 还有12个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I had 12 others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.49,0:22:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你为什么选他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you pick him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他勤快 要的工钱也低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well he was handy and would come cheap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 只要一半工资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At half wages in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个文森特·斯波尔丁 长什么模样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he like,this Vincent Spalding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瘦高个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,well he's tall,slightly built{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}动作敏捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's very quick in his ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.51,0:22:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未蓄胡须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got no hair on his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前额上有块被硫酸烧伤的白色伤疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a white splash of acid on his forehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有注意到他耳朵上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,have you ever observed whether his ears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有戴耳环用的穿孔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been pierced for earrings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有 有 他说一个吉普赛人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,yes,he told me a gypsy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.13,0:22:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他年少时给他穿的孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had done it for him when he was a lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:22:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还在你那里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is still with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:22:59.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我刚离开他不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I just left him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威尔逊先生 你会在店里吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wilson,You will be at your shop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.81,0:23:04.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我找你的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I should need you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想过晚餐的时候歇业休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I had thought of shutting up shop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.45,0:23:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为文森特建议我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at dinner time today because Vincent had suggested{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:11.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去巴金与我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spend the rest of the weekend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}共度周末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my sister in Barking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整件事令我 精神极度紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole business has upset my nerves very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.40,0:23:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个周末你可以 在巴金好好放松一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you enjoy a restful weekend in Barking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.49,0:23:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天是星期六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today's Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.41,0:23:24.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期一我们即可做出结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Monday we should have a conclusion for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:27.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于咨询费的问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the matter of your fee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:29.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信有人会替你付的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe it will be paid for by another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你今天过得愉快 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day to you Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you make of it all Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么也没看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make nothing of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事儿太玄乎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most mysterious business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.37,0:23:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是还有更大的阴谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet there are graver issues{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}隐藏在这件事情背后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hanging from this affair then that first had appeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接下来你打算怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得抽三斗烟的时间才能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is quite a three pipe problem{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.87,0:24:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}50分钟内请不要和我搭话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I beg that you won't speak to me for 50 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红发会事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The business of the Red Headed League{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.64,0:24:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经结束了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is concluded sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.87,0:24:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信一定能圆满解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satisfactorily I trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.03,0:24:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常令人满意 很高兴向您汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most satisfactorily professor I am pleased to report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.38,0:24:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.52,0:25:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.13,0:25:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}劳驾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.32,0:25:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请问从这儿到河滨大街怎么走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me the way to the Strand from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.23,0:25:54.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在第三个路口右拐 到第四个路口左拐 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,third right,fourth left sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.41,0:25:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.77,0:26:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我都可以告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes,I could have told you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.67,0:26:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.30,0:26:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为何用手杖敲人行道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why did you beat the pavement with your stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我们在敌人的领地侦察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson we are spies in an enemy's territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a hobby of mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.69,0:26:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}熟悉伦敦每一次细微的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have an exact knowledge of London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里有一家莫蒂麦烟草店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there's Mortimore's,the tobacconist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.81,0:26:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个小售报摊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little newspaper shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.06,0:26:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}城市和郊区银行的科伯格分行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coburg Branch,the City and Suburban Bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.07,0:26:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦克法兰马车制造厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McFarland's Carriage Building Depot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.91,0:26:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}转角处有一家素食店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the vegetarian restaurant around the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.69,0:27:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 想想刚才的情景 我们有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson commit to memory,it's just possible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.49,0:27:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正被人监视着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we're being observed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.64,0:27:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个大罪案即将发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A considerable crime's in contemplation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.63,0:27:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天是星期六 在某程度上使事情更为复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today being Saturday somewhat complicates matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.32,0:27:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是现在 医生… 工作已经完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now doctor... our work is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.31,0:27:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是时候消遣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time we had some play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.08,0:27:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨拉萨蒂下午在 圣詹姆斯会堂表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarasate's playing at Sir James Hall this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.41,0:27:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先来份三明治和一杯咖啡？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sandwich and a cup of coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.28,0:27:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后去小提琴演奏厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then off to violin land with all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.10,0:27:44.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感受美妙而优雅的气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}its sweetness,delicacy and harmony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.87,0:27:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有红头发委托人 出难题困扰我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no red headed clients to vex us with their conundrums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.24,0:28:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他整个下午都坐在观众席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the afternoon he sat in the stalls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.03,0:28:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沉醉在欢乐的意境中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wrapped in the most perfect happiness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他满脸的微笑 迷离的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while his gently smiling face,and his languid dreamy eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和做大侦探时的福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were as unlike those of Holmes the sleuth hound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.34,0:28:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}神态迥异 判若两人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as it was possible to conceive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.02,0:28:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看着他完全融入音乐当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I saw him so enwrapped in music{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.32,0:28:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得一个邪恶的时刻可能即将来临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt that an evil time might be coming upon those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.90,0:28:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而他会追查到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had set himself to hunt down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.94,0:29:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩绝伦 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.49,0:29:41.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有做制图师的才华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a future as a cartographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:43.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是阿瑟尔尼·琼斯侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will be Athelney Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.49,0:29:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为有苏格兰场的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was well enough to have someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.91,0:29:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与我们同往比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Scotland Yard with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:48.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在侦探这个行业 算是个低能儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an absolute imbecile at his profession{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.56,0:29:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但抓人的时候顽强得像只大龙虾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he does the tenacity of a lobster when he gets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.50,0:29:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一遇到罪犯就紧抓不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his claws into someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.71,0:29:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们又成为搭档了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're working in couples again,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.09,0:30:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这位朋友是个追猎高手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our friend is a wonderful man for starting a chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他所需的仅是一条 帮他捕获猎物的老狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he needs is an old dog to help him do the running down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.27,0:30:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅里韦瑟先生 我的朋友和同事华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Merryweather,my friend and college Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.04,0:30:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.81,0:30:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只希望我们的追捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only hope a wild goose may not prove{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.85,0:30:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要徒劳无功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be the end of our chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.61,0:30:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就我个人而言 并不看好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not personally in favor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.13,0:30:14.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}业余犯罪调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of amateur criminal investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该对福尔摩斯先生充满信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might place considerable confidence in Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.81,0:30:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然您这么说 琼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,if you say so Mr. Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.83,0:30:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他自有一套办法 要是他不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has his own little methods,which if he won't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.22,0:30:23.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这么说 有点过于理论化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mind me saying so a little theoretical{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.14,0:30:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和妙想天开 但他倒是具有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fantastic,but he has the makings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.25,0:30:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侦探的素质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a detective in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.95,0:30:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我还是要说 正如我说过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do say as I've said before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.91,0:30:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}科伯格分行非常安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Colburg Branch of the Bank is as well secured{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.69,0:30:33.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如伦敦任一座楼房一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as any building in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是不可能被破门而入的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't a possibility that it could be broken into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.34,0:30:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连保险公司顾问都这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even insurance assessors agree on that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.34,0:30:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而先生 你应该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you sir should know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.64,0:30:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为银行经理和董事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being not only the resident manager but also the director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.72,0:30:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应该知道 并且确实知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should know and I do know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:46.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有 这可是我27年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is more,this is the first time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.15,0:30:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头一次错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for seven and twenty years that I've missed my{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.99,0:30:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}俱乐部的周六威士忌之夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saturday night of whiskey at my club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.74,0:30:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我造成很大的不便啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I find myself extremely inconvenienced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你会发现 今晚的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that you will find the game tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.71,0:31:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更加刺激 赌注将会是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much more exciting and the stake will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.65,0:31:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好几千英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for many,many thousands of pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.15,0:31:06.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的奖赏是什么呢？福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what will be my reward be Mr. Homes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位年轻人 名叫克莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young man,called Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.65,0:31:12.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约翰·克莱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Clay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.44,0:31:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我真想抓住那个恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,how I'd like to get my hands on that devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.16,0:31:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.29,0:31:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生所说这个年轻人是个绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This young fellow's a gentleman as Mr. Holmes says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.36,0:31:19.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但背叛了自己的阶层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's turned against his class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.46,0:31:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如恶魔般狡诈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's as cunning as the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.01,0:31:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如鳝鱼般圆滑 把杀人和诈骗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slippery as an eel and he's turned crib cracking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.25,0:31:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当作一门艺术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and forgery into a fine art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其祖父是王室公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His grandfather was a royal duke{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.16,0:31:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他本人曾在伊顿公学 和牛津大学念过书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he himself was educated at Eaton and Oxford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:35.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以 华生 带上枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Watson,bring the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.47,0:31:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧 先生们 马车就在楼下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come gentlemen our cab is below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保险库的钥匙只有两把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are only two keys to the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.79,0:33:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一把 行长有一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have one,the chairman holds the other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.65,0:33:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放在他的私人保险柜里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in his personal safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从上面攻进来相当困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you are certainly not vulnerable from above.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.43,0:33:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从下面来也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor from below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.35,0:33:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}稍等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.36,0:33:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您小声一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to ask you to be a little more quiet please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.37,0:34:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您找个箱子坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might I get you to sit on one of those boxes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.10,0:34:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not to interfere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.08,0:34:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根本不可能有小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way in which a thief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.44,0:34:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能够强行闯入银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could break into this bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.35,0:34:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么特殊原因使得小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a special reason why a thief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.43,0:34:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想要强行闯入这个银行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should want to break into this bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么特别的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing particularly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.03,0:35:03.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去几个月进来的东西呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something in the past few months?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:07.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想对我们隐藏的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that you had concealed from us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.66,0:35:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是机密信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The information I have is confidential{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.53,0:35:12.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有银行董事才知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}known only to the directors of the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.36,0:35:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能把它泄露给公众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not to be divulged to members of the public,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.96,0:35:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}业余侦探也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not even amateur detectives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是私人顾问侦探 梅里韦瑟先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Private consulting detective,Mr. Merryweather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.76,0:35:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在打击犯罪上独一无二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unique in the annuls of crime I believe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.91,0:35:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道不是吗 警官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't that so inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.45,0:35:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.68,0:35:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我建议你与福尔摩斯先生合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I advise you to cooperate with Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.09,0:35:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其在这个时候 我正想法设法帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially as at this moment I am trying to save your skin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.08,0:35:38.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和其他董事度过危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that of your fellow directors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.91,0:35:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么到底是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.74,0:35:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的法国黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our French gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.09,0:35:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几个月前我们恰好有机会增加资金来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had occasion some months ago to strengthen our resources{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.67,0:35:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从法兰西银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and borrowed for that purpose 60,000 Napoleons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.70,0:35:52.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}借了6万拿破仑金币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the bank of France.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.87,0:35:57.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们的黄金储备就比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore our reserve of bullion is much larger than is usual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.48,0:35:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他分行多很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in such a branch of the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.09,0:36:03.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些金币在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.21,0:36:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生坐的那些大箱子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crates upon which Dr. Watson sits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.43,0:36:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}装着3万拿破仑金币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}contain 30,000 Napoleons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.26,0:36:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用铅箔一层一层包着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wrapped between layers of lead foil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.65,0:36:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以看看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May we see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.40,0:38:25.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这比我当初所想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is much bolder and larger in conception{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.83,0:38:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更大胆 更大规模 难道不是吗 琼斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than I had first thought,wouldn't you say Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.02,0:38:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.32,0:38:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位克莱更像个业余探险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Clay's more of an amateur adventurer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.34,0:38:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是冲动型罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or spur of the moment criminal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长期计划不是克莱的风格 一点都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long planning is not Clay's type at all sir,not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.97,0:38:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非他是别人手中的棋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless he's a pawn in a much larger game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.45,0:38:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅里韦瑟先生 有人探知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Merryweather someone has had access to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.32,0:38:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最机密的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}information of the most confidential sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.26,0:38:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}制定了周密详尽的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful plans have been made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.12,0:38:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是经人精心筹划的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mastermind has been at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.49,0:39:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you suggesting that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.53,0:39:05.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说这非常像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am suggesting that it bears the hallmarks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.81,0:39:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂教授的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Professor Moriarity's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.87,0:39:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moriarity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who is this Moriarity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.33,0:39:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们并不清楚 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't really know sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.95,0:39:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和警方都不曾想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is neither the police nor I think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.79,0:39:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生已经在盯着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes here has ever set eyes on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.26,0:39:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的名字在黑社会人所皆知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name echoes and re-echoes throughout the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.21,0:39:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然他出身高贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears that he's a man of good birth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受过极好的教育 但是他继承了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an excellent education but he has hereditary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.52,0:39:40.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恶魔般的特质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tendencies of the most diabolical kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.90,0:39:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}血液里充斥着犯罪的因子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A criminal strain runs in his blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.34,0:39:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}日趋严重 变得相当危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which has increased and rendered infinitely more dangerous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.66,0:39:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他的智力 非比寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by his extraordinary mental powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.83,0:39:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他组织了这座城市中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the organizer of half that is evil and nearly all that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.16,0:40:00.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}半数罪案和几乎所有未被识破的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is undetected in this great city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却一直逍遥法外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is never caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.44,0:40:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有手下被抓 但作为中坚力量的他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His agent is caught but the central power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.37,0:40:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直逍遥法外 甚至没有被怀疑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is never caught certainly even suspected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.43,0:40:19.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教授今晚是不会出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall not see the professor tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.14,0:40:29.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚的敌人的唯一退路是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way for tonight's enemy to escape is through{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.57,0:40:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经由当铺逃窜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the pawn brokers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.97,0:40:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经有一个警官守在门口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's already an inspector at the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.57,0:40:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时间差不多到了… 各就各位…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have only a few moments... positions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.38,0:40:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能麻烦你把灯关掉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you be so kind as to put out this lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后坐在黑暗中？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sit in the dark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.00,0:40:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.55,0:40:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能冒险发出亮光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot risk the presence of light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.12,0:41:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦我亮出灯光 动作迅速…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I shine the light,act swiftly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.93,0:41:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他们肆无忌惮的开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they fire have no compassion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.59,0:41:14.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马上击毙他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about shooting them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.35,0:43:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.51,0:43:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快逃 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump at it,jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.34,0:43:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没用的 约翰·克莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no good jump John Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.21,0:43:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你逃不掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no chance at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.95,0:43:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.21,0:43:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我的同伴会没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though I fancy my pal's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.41,0:43:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在他正跑向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this moment he is running into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.14,0:44:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察的环抱中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the welcoming arms of the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.83,0:44:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你做得还真是天衣无缝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to have done the thing very completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.08,0:44:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该称赞你才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must compliment you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.41,0:44:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.86,0:44:10.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是夏洛克·福尔摩斯 私人侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Sherlock Holmes,a private investigator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.60,0:44:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没怀疑过你是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't for a moment suspect your being{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.64,0:44:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a policeman Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.22,0:44:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得了吧 回去再聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,hold that one off for the Darby's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.46,0:44:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别用你那脏手碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you to take your filthy hands off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们不知道我的血管里流着皇家血统吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may not be aware that I have royal blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.61,0:44:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你们跟我说话的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my veins and be so kind as to say "sir" and "please"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.48,0:44:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都要用"先生"和"请"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you address me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.89,0:44:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.95,0:44:32.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请先生上台阶吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you please sir,mind marching upstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.09,0:44:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会用马车将阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while we get a cab to transport your highness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.54,0:44:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}送到警署\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the police station?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.84,0:44:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这还差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.16,0:44:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.95,0:44:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 有个问题 克莱先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,one question Mr. Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.24,0:44:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂教授是否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right in thinking that professor Moriarity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.69,0:45:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}策划了红发会事件？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was somewhere behind the idea of the Red Headed League?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.60,0:45:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我建议你再也不要提起这个名字 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you keep that name off your lips Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.09,0:45:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你还想将来活得好好的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you value your future well-being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.51,0:45:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的 先生们 我都不知道说什么好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really gentlemen,I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.91,0:45:19.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我 福尔摩斯先生 我竟怀疑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please forgive me Mr. Holmes for ever doubting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.47,0:45:22.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的神机妙算 经天纬地之才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your outstanding,your brilliant qualities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.23,0:45:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 你用最完美的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no doubt you've detected and defeated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.93,0:45:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侦查并破获了这起严谨周密的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the most complete manner one of the boldest attempts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.65,0:45:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}银行盗窃案 真是闻所未闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at bank robbery that has ever come within my experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.55,0:45:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅里韦瑟先生 这件事情上我有点破费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Merryweather I have then some small expense over this matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.12,0:45:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望银行能给予补偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall expect the bank to refund.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.90,0:45:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course,of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.53,0:46:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会是早知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't do you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.33,0:46:41.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样行不通吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it won't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.96,0:46:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:45.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 我们令您失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry we failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.20,0:46:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯在侦探这行只是个外行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes is a mere amateur in the field of detection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.06,0:47:03.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他看起来是个聪明人 或是运气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still he seems a clever man or a lucky one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.43,0:47:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有碍我事的本领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he has a positive talent for getting in my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.21,0:47:12.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要除掉他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should he be removed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.71,0:47:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能有这个必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.88,0:47:18.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但会令人失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be disappointing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.99,0:47:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得他很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find him interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.01,0:47:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信这是他第三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe this is the third time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.68,0:47:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我添麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he has incommoded me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.14,0:47:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果再继续下去 那么当然要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this continues then certainly something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.01,0:47:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做点什么来刺激一下福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will have to be done to encourage Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.45,0:47:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他要么离开 要么靠边站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}either to withdraw or stand clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.87,0:47:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.38,0:48:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 治安官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.14,0:48:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg your pardon Dr. Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.04,0:48:24.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这一切太让人难以承受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this has all been too much for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.83,0:48:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顾客都敬重我 因我值得信赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My clients respect me as a man of confidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.09,0:48:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我现在还有什么自信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but where's the confidence left here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.22,0:48:31.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全毁了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm utterly ruined...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.66,0:48:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 开心点 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,cheer up Mr. Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.75,0:48:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等清理完残局后 会感觉好点的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll feel better when you've cleared up the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.85,0:48:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说的是很对…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's all very well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.30,0:48:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 让我把这个给您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Mr. Holmes asked me to give you this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.89,0:48:44.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}50块金币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 sovereigns with the compliments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.39,0:48:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}城市和郊区银行敬赠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the City and Suburban Bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.86,0:48:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's fair enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.86,0:48:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生医生 这比我的期望好太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,Dr. Watson,this is more than acceptable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.39,0:48:54.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请代我问候夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my compliments to Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.97,0:48:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也向你致意 威尔逊先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he sends the same to you Mr. Wilson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.17,0:48:58.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点忠告…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a word of advice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.96,0:49:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下次你雇用伙计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time you engage an assistant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.71,0:49:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}付他适当的薪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pay him the proper wage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.61,0:49:04.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.23,0:49:28.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 福尔摩斯 我确信自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,Holmes,I trust I am not more dense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.39,0:49:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并不比别人笨拙 可我看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than my neighbors and yet here I have seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.61,0:49:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所看到的 听到你所听到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you have seen,heard what you have heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.75,0:49:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而你不仅对已经发生的事情了如指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet you have seen clearly not only what had happened,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.27,0:49:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且还知道将要发生什么 可我仍然觉得自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what was about to happen while to me the whole business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.17,0:49:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一头雾水 不知道发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was still confused and grotesque.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.42,0:49:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生 回想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson recollect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.74,0:49:46.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我听到那个伙计只要求一半薪水时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I heard that the assistant had come for half wages,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.80,0:49:49.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很明显他带着某种目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was obvious that he had some motive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.10,0:49:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为确保事情在他掌控之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for securing the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.94,0:49:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可你如何猜透他的动机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,but how did you know what his motive was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.44,0:49:55.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若那个当铺有女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had there been a woman in the house I would have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.02,0:49:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会怀疑不过是些庸俗的风流事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}suspected immediately if some vulgar intrigue,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.39,0:50:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但当我听到威尔逊先生说起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when I heard from Mr. Wilson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.06,0:50:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}硫酸烧伤的疤和打过耳洞的耳朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the acid stain and the pierced ears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.66,0:50:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就知道文森特·斯波尔丁和约翰·克莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew that Vincent Spalding and John Clay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.65,0:50:07.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是同一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were the same person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.70,0:50:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克莱为什么在那里呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why was Clay there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.89,0:50:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}照相就是线索所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The photography gave you the clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.73,0:50:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.06,0:50:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}地下室 他在地下室做着某种勾当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cellar,he was working on something in the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.15,0:50:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天都干好几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something which took many hours a day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.07,0:50:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整整两个月 肯定是在挖地道 但通向哪里呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for two months on end. He was tunneling but where to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.85,0:50:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天我用手杖敲打人行道时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I tapped my stick on the pavement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.35,0:50:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过想弄清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the street that day I was ascertaining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.74,0:50:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果那条地道是从前面通向房子后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether the tunnel stretched in front or behind the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.45,0:50:37.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它在前边 是朝后延伸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in front,towards the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.39,0:50:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从这儿到河滨大街怎么走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you tell me the way to the strand from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.17,0:50:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我立即便认出是克莱 并拖延了他的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recognized Clay immediately and delayed him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.69,0:50:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仔细观察了他的膝盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have time to examine his knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.81,0:50:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然他花了很多时间挖隧道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he spoke clearly of many hours or tunneling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.67,0:50:54.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问连通了错综复杂的下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt linking up with a maze of sewers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.23,0:50:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在萨克斯科伯格广场下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beneath Saxe Coburg Square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.20,0:50:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们关闭红发会办公室时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they closed the Red Headed League offices,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.21,0:50:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就标志着他们不再在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was a sign they no longer cared about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.01,0:51:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰贝斯·威尔逊是否在当铺里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jay Beards Wilson's presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.84,0:51:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换句话说 地道已经挖通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In other words the tunnel was complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.12,0:51:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会在星期六采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that they would make the attempt on a Saturday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.64,0:51:07.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是猜测？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was just a guess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.09,0:51:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你令我失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,you disappoint me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.04,0:51:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从不猜测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.70,0:51:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期六晚上偷盗金块 是再好不过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saturday's an excellent night for stealing bullion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.00,0:51:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样便有一整天时间逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gives you a full day to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.20,0:51:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请拿好 慢走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.82,0:51:26.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.95,0:51:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的讲解真是精彩绝伦 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,you've reasoned it out beautifully Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.28,0:51:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像一根长长的链条 每一个环节都天衣无缝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so long a chain and yet every link rings true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.55,0:51:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样我才不会无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It saved me from irony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时我觉得我这一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know sometimes I think my whole life is spent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.53,0:51:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都在苦苦挣扎以摆脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in one long effort to escape from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庸碌平凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the common places of existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.32,0:51:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.22,0:51:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是个福泽人间的精英 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a benefactor of the race Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.03,0:51:49.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 也许小有用处吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well maybe it is of some little use after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.64,0:51:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人是渺小的 著作就是一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"L'homme c'est rien... l'oeuvre c'est tout"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.28,0:51:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如居斯塔夫·福楼拜写信给乔治·桑时所言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as Gusta Flabare wrote to George Sand.{\r}
